    <div class="about-positioning-copy">
      <p class="about-lead">I work with founders and teams to turn an early idea or a fragmented product into a clear direction people can understand and use.</p>
      <p>I start by looking for the signal: what people need, what the market already says, and where a product can become genuinely useful. From there, I shape the product story into flows, interfaces and decisions that can hold together in the real world.</p>
      <p>UI, brand and design systems make that direction tangible. My creative practice keeps me attentive to emotion, tone and the small details that make an experience feel human.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

